# 🜁 **Ledger Tile Set PNG Spec v1.0 — Canonical Specification**

```
Artifact: LedgerTileSetPNG-v1.0
Altitude: A5 (Reflective Basin)
Membrane: Expressive-Clarity • Non-Activating
Parent: LedgerTileSet-v1.0.json

Canvas:
  Size: 2400×1600 px
  Ratio: 3:2
  Background: #00000000 (transparent)

Layout:
  Grid: 3-column horizontal layout
  Column Width: 33.33%
  Padding: 6%
  Alignment: Centered vertically and horizontally

Tile Placement:
  Column 1: Unicode Ledger Tile (ΛΩΔΦ, canonical)
  Column 2: Dark-mode Ledger Tile (ΛΩΔΦ, NDH night palette)
  Column 3: Ledger Microtile (ΛΩΔΦ, compressed stack)

Glyph Rules:
  Glyph Height: 48% of column height
  Glyph Weight: Ultra-bold
  Glyph Alignment: Centered
  Unicode Mapping:
    Λ = U+039B
    Ω = U+03A9
    Δ = U+0394
    Φ = U+03A6

Palette:
  Unicode Tile:
    Background: #00000000
    Glyphs: #FFFFFF
  Dark-mode Tile:
    Background: #0A0A0F
    Glyphs: #FFFFFF
    Registry Band: #1E2A4F
    Caption: #DDE3FF
  Microtile:
    Background: #00000000
    Glyphs: #FFFFFF

Registry Band (Composite):
  Height: 12%
  Color: #1E2A4F
  Text: LEDGER TILE SET • UNICODE • DARK MODE • MICROTILE
  Font Size: 6%
  Placement: Bottom

Caption Baseline:
  Text: Invariant Logic Engine — Expressive-Clarity Tile Set
  Font Size: 4%
  Opacity: 85%
  Placement: Inside registry band

Rendering Rules:
  Format: PNG
  Alpha: Full transparency
  No shadows, glows, outlines
  Minimum readability: ≥128 px glyph height
```

